<body><main class="policy"><p><a href="index.php">← BLife PH</a></p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated: November 24, 2026</strong></p>
<p>BLife PH supports connections between members, people requesting blood, donors, and authorized healthcare institutions. The platform does not replace medical screening or emergency services.</p>
<h2>Information we store</h2><p>Account information includes your name, email, phone number, blood type, and province. We also store content you submit, such as community posts, blood requests, donation offers, responses, messages, and notifications. Login session records are used to show and revoke active sessions.</p>
<h2>What members can see</h2><p>Donor directory participation is optional. When enabled, your profile fields are shown only according to the choices in Settings &amp; Privacy. Phone number and email are not shown in donor search. Location discovery uses approximate province-level information; precise residential coordinates should not be published. Blood requests and donation offers you publish are handled according to their own visibility and status.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can change directory and location-discovery settings, request an account data export, update your email after verification, deactivate your account, or submit an account deletion request from Settings &amp; Privacy. A deletion request is reviewed to protect conversations, transactions, safety records, and legal obligations; submission does not itself erase those records.</p>
<h2>Security and sharing</h2><p>BLife PH uses password hashing, access controls, and session protections. Information is used to provide platform features, protect the service, and support authorized moderation. Do not post patient records, test results, home addresses, or other sensitive medical details. We do not promise that online services are risk-free.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>No verified privacy contact address is configured in this project. Please use the platform's existing support channel or contact the site administrator for privacy requests.</p>
